    "scenesThatPass": [
      "SNOW WHITE: Hello?... What's your name? Rose, sitting in a dark corner, goes to her cell bars and looks out.\nROSE: I am Rose. Snow White smiles - a friendly face.",
      "SNOW WHITE: She's so beautiful.\nANNA: That is not a kind thing to say in these times. Youth one cannot alter... beauty, however. We have sacrificed beauty to raise our children i…",
      "SNOW WHITE: Ten years you locked me away! Ravenna seems to relish this.\nRAVENNA: And every day, every hour led you to this ,moment. It burned inside you. It drove you forward, and here you are.. Listening only to her hear…\nRAVENNA: That's it. Fight. Fight for your land... for your loss and for Hope!\nRAVENNA: Watch them die. You gave them hope and they believed you. You have lead them to their deaths. How foolish your followers."
    ]
  },
